# Paths deleted from the vendored subcharts after `helm dependency update`.
# One path per line, relative to this chart directory. Comments with #.
#
# The coturn chart declares CloudNativePG and Percona XtraDB as conditional
# dependencies, so that anyone enabling coturn's own user database gets one
# without bringing an operator. Both are gated off here - coturn uses its
# built-in sqlite userdb, and databases belong to the db operators, not to an
# application chart - so the bundled copies render nothing. The published
# tarball carries them regardless, which is why this file exists: without it
# they come back on the next version bump.
charts/coturn/charts/cluster
charts/coturn/charts/pxc-db
